{{!
    @template enrol_apply/review

    One enrolment application, with the controls to decide it.

    The POST this form makes is the same one the queue makes, which is why manage.php's
    handler needs no branch of its own: a formaction naming the decision, a non-empty
    userenrolments array, and the session key. The applicant id travels in a hidden input
    rather than a checkbox because there is only ever one of them here, and each decision is
    a submit button carrying its own formaction value, so the button that was pressed is the
    decision that is taken.

    Every value below is the PLAIN spelling and is output through a double stash, which
    escapes each exactly once. That includes the course name: format_string()'s escape flag
    defaults to true, so the renderer asks for the plain spelling explicitly.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formurl string - url the decision form posts back to
    * sesskey string - session key guarding the state change
    * userenrolmentid int - the application being decided
    * courselabel string - label of the course row
    * coursename string - full name of the course applied for, plain spelling
    * courseurl string - link to the course
    * appliedlabel string - label of the application date row
    * applied string - when the application was submitted, already formatted
    * statuslabel string - label of the state row
    * status string - whether the application is pending or on the waiting list
    * commentlabel string - label of the applicant's comment
    * hascomment boolean - whether the applicant wrote one
    * comment string - what the applicant wrote, plain spelling
    * nocomment string - what to say when they wrote nothing
    * everything enrol_apply/decision_controls requires
    * actions array - one entry per decision, each with a formaction value and its label

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?userenrol=42",
        "sesskey": "Ab12Cd34Ef",
        "userenrolmentid": 42,
        "courselabel": "Course",
        "coursename": "R&D < Team induction",
        "courseurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=7",
        "appliedlabel": "Application date",
        "applied": "25/08/26, 09:14",
        "statuslabel": "State",
        "status": "Pending",
        "commentlabel": "Comment",
        "hascomment": true,
        "comment": "I would like to join this course.",
        "nocomment": "The applicant did not write anything.",
        "hasgroups": true,
        "grouplabel": "Groups to join on approval",
        "grouphelp": "Leave empty to use the groups configured on the enrolment method.",
        "groups": [
            {"id": 3, "name": "Tutorial A"}
        ],
        "hasroles": true,
        "rolelabel": "Role to assign on approval",
        "rolehelp": "Leave it alone to use the role configured on the enrolment method.",
        "roledefault": "Use the enrolment method's role",
        "roles": [
            {"id": 5, "name": "Student"}
        ],
        "messagelabel": "Message to the applicant",
        "messagehelp": "Included in the message they receive. Optional.",
        "actions": [
            {"value": "confirm", "label": "Confirm requests", "primary": true},
            {"value": "wait", "label": "Defer requests", "primary": false},
            {"value": "cancel", "label": "Cancel requests", "primary": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<form id="enrol_apply_review_form" class="enrol_apply-review" method="post" action="{{formurl}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="userenrolments[]" value="{{userenrolmentid}}">
    <dl class="enrol_apply-application row">
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{courselabel}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9"><a href="{{courseurl}}">{{coursename}}</a></dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{appliedlabel}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{applied}}</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{statuslabel}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{status}}</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{commentlabel}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">
            {{#hascomment}}{{comment}}{{/hascomment}}
            {{^hascomment}}<span class="text-muted">{{nocomment}}</span>{{/hascomment}}
        </dd>
    </dl>
    {{> enrol_apply/decision_controls }}
    <div class="enrol_apply-reviewactions mt-3 d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {{#actions}}
            <button type="submit" name="formaction" value="{{value}}"
                class="btn {{#primary}}btn-primary{{/primary}}{{^primary}}btn-secondary{{/primary}}">
                {{label}}
            </button>
        {{/actions}}
    </div>
</form>
